  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the latest Open Beta, VRChat added a new feature that lets Desktop users right-click someone to open their profile. While this is a useful addition, some game worlds rely on right-click for gameplay, such as firing weapons or aiming. In those worlds, the new “right-click to open profile” behavior can make them unplayable. This is a serious compatibility issues.\n\nIt may be worth considering a world-level toggle to disable this function, or at least adding a user option so players can turn it off.",
